<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Untitled Document</title>
    <script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/mathjax/2.7.7/MathJax.js?config=TeX-MML-AM_CHTML"></script>
    <style>
        @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Georgia:wght@400;700&amp;family=Helvetica:wght@400;700&amp;display=swap');
        body {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            font-family: 'Georgia', serif;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #111;
            background: #fff;
            max-width: 100%;
            overflow-x: hidden;
        }
        .document-container {
            margin: 40px auto;
            max-width: 850px;
            padding: 0 20px;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }
        h1, h2, h3 {
            font-family: 'Helvetica', sans-serif;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }
        h1 {
            font-size: 24pt;
            font-weight: bold;
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
        }
        h2 {
            font-size: 18pt;
            font-weight: bold;
            margin: 20px 0 8px 0;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #222;
            padding-bottom: 4px;
        }
        p {
            margin: 8px 0;
            text-align: justify;
        }
        .placeholder {
            border: 2px dashed #888;
            background: #f8f8f8;
            display: inline-block;
            text-align: center;
            font-style: italic;
            color: #666;
            padding: 20px;
            margin: 15px 0;
            width: 100%;
            min-height: 80px;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            position: relative;
        }
        .placeholder::before {
            content: attr(data-caption);
            font-size: 12pt;
            color: #666;
        }
        .single-column {
            max-width: 700px;
            margin-left: auto;
            margin-right: auto;
        }
        .two-column {
            display: flex;
            gap: 40px;
        }
        .column {
            flex: 1;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
        }
        .column-left {
            width: 50%;
        }
        .column-right {
            width: 50%;
        }
        .header-block {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }
        .signature-line {
            border-top: 1px solid #000;
            width: 200px;
            margin-top: 40px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }
        .stamp {
            border: 3px solid #c00;
            padding: 10px;
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 14pt;
            font-weight: bold;
            transform: rotate(-8deg);
            margin: 20px auto;
            max-width: 180px;
        }
        .small-text {
            font-size: 10pt;
            font-family: 'Helvetica', sans-serif;
        }
        @media print {
            body { margin: 0; }
            .document-container { margin: 0; padding: 0; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="document-container">
        <!-- Title/Header Block -->
        <div class="header-block">
            <h1>NOTICE OF PUBLIC HEARING</h1>
            <p style="font-size: 14pt; margin: 15px 0 5px;"><strong>BEFORE THE BOARD OF SUPERVISORS</strong></p>
            <p style="font-size: 14pt; margin: 5px 0;">County of Placer, State of California</p>
            <p style="font-size: 12pt; margin-top: 30px;">In the Matter of the Petition of [Petitioner Name], for the formation of a community facilities district (CFD No. [number])</p>
            <p style="font-size: 12pt; font-style: italic; margin-top: 10px;">[Case No. _______________] [Hearing Date _______________]</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Body Text -->
        <div class="single-column">
            <p>TO ALL INTERESTED PERSONS: NOTICE IS HEREBY GIVEN that the Board of Supervisors of the County of Placer, State of California, will hold a public hearing on the petition filed by [Petitioner Name] for the formation of a community facilities district (CFD No. [number]) pursuant to the Mello-Roos Community Facilities Act of 1982 (Government Code Section 53311 et seq.).</p>

            <p>The hearing will be held on [Date] at [Time] in the Board of Supervisors Chambers, located at [Address].</p>

            <p>At the hearing, the Board of Supervisors will consider the establishment of the community facilities district, the proposed financing plan, the proposed rate and method of apportionment of the special tax, and any other matters related to the formation of the district.</p>

            <p>Any interested person may appear at the hearing and be heard with respect to any matter contained in the petition or any question of fact or law related to the establishment of the district.</p>

            <p>Written protests or comments may be submitted to the Clerk of the Board of Supervisors at [Address] or via email at [email].</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Signature Section -->
        <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 80px;">
            <div class="signature-line"></div>
            <p style="font-weight: bold;">[Board of Supervisors Chairperson Signature Block]</p>
            <p style="font-size: 11pt; margin-top: 20px;">Clerk of the Board of Supervisors</p>
            <p style="font-size: 11pt;">County of Placer, State of California</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Placeholder for Official Seal/Stamp -->
        <div class="placeholder" data-caption="[Official County Seal/Stamp: Upper Right]" style="position: absolute; top: 120px; right: 80px; width: 120px; height: 120px; font-size: 10pt; border: 3px solid #000;">
            SEAL<br>
            COUNTY OF PLACER<br>
            STATE OF CALIFORNIA
        </div>

        <!-- Footer -->
        <div style="text-align: center; font-size: 9pt; margin-top: 60px; color: #444;">
            This notice is published in accordance with California Government Code Section 53320.<br>
            [Date of Publication]
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
```
